WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:04.965
A read-only shared plan: The link shows a copy. Viewing it does not change either person’s saved plan.

2
00:00:04.965 --> 00:00:12.427
Copy into this guest plan: Copy replaces this guest’s semesters. The chosen current semester stays; only copied courses leave the wish list.

3
00:00:12.427 --> 00:00:17.483
Your own independent copy: The copied plan is saved here. The original sender’s plan has not changed.
